---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Financial Education | Zeta"
  description="Explore educational resources on financial literacy, professional development, and responsible financial conversations from Zeta."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell narrow">

      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow-light">Financial Education</p>

      <h1>Knowledge That Supports Better Financial Conversations</h1>

      <p>
        Zeta believes that financial education empowers people to make more
        informed decisions. Our educational resources are designed to
        strengthen financial literacy, encourage thoughtful planning, and
        support professional development through practical, easy-to-understand
        learning.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Featured Topics -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="shell article-grid">

      <article>

        <p class="card-kicker">Financial Foundations</p>

        <h2>Preparing an Emergency Fund</h2>

        <p>
          Understand the purpose of an emergency fund, practical saving
          strategies, and important considerations when building financial
          resilience for unexpected circumstances.
        </p>

        <a class="text-link" href="#">
          Read Article
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

      </article>

      <article>

        <p class="card-kicker">Financial Planning</p>

        <h2>Setting Meaningful Financial Goals</h2>

        <p>
          Explore practical approaches to identifying priorities, defining
          clear objectives, and creating financial goals that align with your
          personal or family aspirations.
        </p>

        <a class="text-link" href="#">
          Read Article
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

      </article>

      <article>

        <p class="card-kicker">Protection Planning</p>

        <h2>Understanding Financial Protection</h2>

        <p>
          Learn how financial protection strategies can help individuals and
          families prepare for life's uncertainties as part of a broader
          financial plan.
        </p>

        <a class="text-link" href="#">
          Read Article
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

      </article>

      <article>

        <p class="card-kicker">Retirement Planning</p>

        <h2>Preparing for the Future</h2>

        <p>
          Discover the value of long-term planning and the role that
          consistency, time, and informed decision-making can play in
          preparing for retirement.
        </p>

        <a class="text-link" href="#">
          Read Article
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

      </article>

      <article>

        <p class="card-kicker">Family Financial Planning</p>

        <h2>Building a Strong Financial Foundation</h2>

        <p>
          Explore general financial planning concepts that can help families
          organize priorities, manage responsibilities, and prepare for
          future goals together.
        </p>

        <a class="text-link" href="#">
          Read Article
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

      </article>

      <article>

        <p class="card-kicker">Professional Development</p>

        <h2>Growing Through Continuous Learning</h2>

        <p>
          Learn how mentorship, reflection, practical experience, and
          consistent learning contribute to long-term professional and
          leadership development.
        </p>

        <a class="text-link" href="#">
          Read Article
          <span aria-hidden="true">→</span>
        </a>

      </article>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Educational Philosophy -->
  <section class="section section-muted">
    <div class="shell narrow">

      <h2>Our Educational Approach</h2>

      <p>
        Zeta is committed to making financial education accessible,
        understandable, and relevant. Our goal is to encourage informed
        conversations, strengthen financial literacy, and provide practical
        knowledge that supports responsible decision-making and lifelong
        learning.
      </p>

      <blockquote>
        "Education creates confidence. Informed conversations create better decisions."
      </blockquote>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Disclaimer -->
  <section class="section" id="disclaimer">
    <div class="shell narrow">

      <h2>Educational Disclaimer</h2>

      <p>
        The information published on this website is provided for general
        educational and informational purposes only. It is not intended to
        constitute personalized financial, investment, insurance, legal,
        accounting, or tax advice, nor should it be relied upon as a
        substitute for consultation with a qualified professional.
      </p>

      <p>
        Financial needs, objectives, and circumstances vary from one
        individual to another. Before making financial decisions, readers
        are encouraged to seek advice appropriate to their personal
        situation from a qualified professional.
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
